We can't just report this error when the feature is stabilized because that could break existing code. If we need to log an unresolved question for this, that's fine! @adetaylor please refer to <https://rustc-dev-guide.rust-lang.org/tests/compiletest.html#revisions>. You can do something like:

```rs
