Add a test case for using the result of a fn call of an associated function of a `const` trait in a struct default field.

```rust
struct X;
trait Trait {
    fn value() -> Self;
}
impl const Trait for X {
    fn value() -> Self { X }
}
struct S<T: const Trait> {
    a: T = T::value(),
}
```

